Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 14:26:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 06/13] Add ROS 2 action-output transport to VLA inference
 runner
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

  - run_vla_inference.py: introduce --transport {zmq,ros2}; factor ZMQ/ROS2
    publisher back-ends; pack toggle_vla_mode into Protocol v4; make ROS 2
    'k' a start/stop toggle mirroring ZMQ (warm-up pulse, then EXIT-VLA/pause)
  - launch_inference.py: default deploy_input_type=zmq_manage.
    Use 'deploy-input-type=ros2' to switch to ROS2.
    Support --deploy-debug tee logging.
  - install_inference.sh: allow PY_VERSION override (default 3.10)
    Note: for ROS2 support，make sure add PY_VERSION=3.12

Signed-off-by: Mao, Roger <roger.mao@intel.com>
